    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a business analyst writing a weekly update for busy sales managers at an insurance company.\nHere is this week's data by channel (premium in MYR, week starting {{ \n$json.week_starting }}):\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.summary) }}\n\nRules:\n- Use ONLY the numbers above. Do not calculate new figures or invent any \ndata.\n- Write a one-sentence headline.\n- Then at most 3 bullet points with the most important findings.\n- Then one suggested action.\n- Plain, confident business English. No hype words.\n- Return simple HTML only: <h3>, <ul>, <li>, <p>. No markdown, no code fences.",
